  "vibe": "A roastery rendered in cocoa brown (#2b1d16) and cream, lit by one burnt-orange ember (#e0662c) with gold as the second voice. Alfa Slab One slams fat slab headlines over a live backdrop: three cream steam curls climb the frame and dissolve as they rise, a gold ring in the lower corner spins eight ember spokes like a cooling tray, and gold beans tumble down end over end. Statement beats kill the world and drop to near-black with gold type; the closing card floods full ember with an ink pill button. The camera pushes and drops on a light 7-8px drift — busy, never frantic. Its mechanics are a roast-curve gauge, a chalkboard price scroll, a switch toggle and a soft cross-fade. Best for roasters, bakeries and distillers — anything sold on smell and heat.",
